      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm a freelance designer and doing my books for the year. i just bought a really expensive ergonomic chair for my home studio and i'm not sure how to log it in quickbooks. should i list it as a business expense or is it more like a personal draw? thanks",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
